 "notes": [
  "Posted 30 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting(7)': Deal is Getting Worse/Alter it Further (This Deal Is Getting Worse All The Time / Pray I Don't Alter It Any Further), Preped D (Prepared Defenses), Mob Points (Mobilization Points), Secret Plans, Imperial Arrest Order, I'm Sorry and CCDowntown Plaza (Cloud City: Downtown Plaza); they count toward the 60. Prepared Defenses brings several Effects, so no single starting effect is set.",
  "Cloud City / Bespin locations dested the Dark pages: 'Bespin' = Bespin (Dark), 'BespinCC' = Bespin: Cloud City (Dark), Cloud City: Downtown Plaza (Dark), Cloud City: Carbonite Chamber (Dark), Cloud City: West Gallery (Dark); 'CCEast Platform' = Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay) (Dark card).",
  "Posted 'Fett w/Blaster' dested Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle; 'IG-88 w/Gun' dested IG-88 With Riot Gun; '4-LOM w/Rifle' dested 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'Darth Vader DLOTS' dested Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'Chimera' dested Chimaera; 'OS-72-1 in Ob1' dested OS-72-1 In Obsidian 1; 'Teemto's Racer' dested Teemto Pagalies' Podracer.",
  "Vibro-Ax dested the Dark page Vibro-Ax (Dark); 'Maul's Saber' / 'Mara's Saber' dested Maul's Lightsaber / Mara Jade's Lightsaber.",
